OL,3,AHeathrow expansion an 'outdated' risk,
OL,4,Amayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it was reviewing
OL,7,Fthe response, while Heathrow questioned
OL,8,Fmany of the claims made in City Hall's
OL,9,Fsubmission.
